*************************************************
* Append GCCRES TXTLIB files meeded by resident BREXX TEXT
*************************************************
FILEDEF INMOVE DISK GCCRES TXTLIB * ( MEMBER CMSCRT0
FILEDEF OUTMOVE DISK BREXX TEXT A ( DISP MOD
MOVEFILE
FILEDEF INMOVE DISK GCCRES TXTLIB * ( MEMBER CMSENTRY
MOVEFILE
FILEDEF INMOVE DISK GCCRES TXTLIB * ( MEMBER CMSRTST@
MOVEFILE
FILEDEF INMOVE DISK GCCRES TXTLIB * ( MEMBER DYNSTK
MOVEFILE
FILEDEF INMOVE DISK GCCRES TXTLIB * ( MEMBER CMSSTUBS
MOVEFILE
*
*COPYFILE CODEEND  TEXT A BREXX    TEXT A (APPEND
* SAVE A BREXX MAP FOR DEBUGGING
LOAD BREXX
COPY LOAD MAP A BREXX MAP A ( OLDDATE REPLACE
ERASE LOAD MAP A
&EXIT 0
